LC 647 — Palindromic Substrings
Pattern:Expand Around Center

Logic:
Every character can be a palindrome center.
Check odd and even length palindromes.
Count each palindrome.

Algorithm:
For every index:
    expand left/right
    count matching characters

CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    int countSubstrings(string s) {
        int ans = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < s.size(); i++) {
            for (int l = i, r = i; l >= 0 && r < s.size() && s[l] == s[r]; l--, r++)
                ans++;

            for (int l = i, r = i + 1; l >= 0 && r < s.size() && s[l] == s[r]; l--, r++)
                ans++;
        }

        return ans;
    }
};

s = "aaa"

"a" → palindrome
"aa" → palindrome
"aaa" → palindrome
"a" → palindrome
"aa" → palindrome
"a" → palindrome

3 single "a"
+ 2 "aa"
+ 1 "aaa"
= 6

Answer = 6 ✅












